## Recommendation: **NARROW**

Run only a corrected B0 diagnostic package before considering B1/B2. An exhaustive native-tokenizer Stage A rerun is unnecessary, but B0 needs a **native-input, matched adapter-only baseline**.

| Question | Verdict | Main conclusion |
|---|---|---|
| Q1 — Role probes | Conditional | Useful accessibility survey; shortcut controls, span audits and corrected statistics are missing. |
| Q2 — Stage A interpretation | Disagree | Screening supports “selectivity unconfirmed,” not a uniquely identified decoder bottleneck. |
| Q3 — B0 layer19 | Conditional | Reasonable fixed local anchor; failure cannot eliminate every layer/interface. |
| Q4 — B0 DoD | Disagree | Needs adaptation contrast, correct-memory improvement and an inconclusive category. |
| Q5 — B1 layers | Conditional | Keep 5/9/12/19 bounded; do not expand the neighborhood sweep. |
| Q6 — B2 comparison | Conditional | Same-layer comparison is conditional, not factorial; generated-text quality should lead. |
| Q7 — Stage C | Defer | Audit metrics and compare matched A1 outputs before authorizing scaling. |
| Q8 — Metrics | Disagree | No-new grounded, bag-character F1 and EOS are insufficient for preservation/factuality. |
| Q9 — T5Gemma2 closure | Agree | Maintain D-107/D-108 STOP; no reopening within this plan. |
| Q10 — Priorities | Disagree | Native/wiring audit → controlled B0 first; defer parallel full role probing. |

### Top Must-fix items
1. **Add a contemporaneous frozen-decoder control:** same 20/20 documents, native cache, initialization, three seeds and training budget.
2. **Control memory length and donor assignment:** Stage A’s shuffled memory changes length/mask alongside content.
3. **Measure useful adaptation:** require improved selectivity *relative to the frozen arm* and improved correct-memory loss—not merely worse wrong-memory loss.
4. **Separate metric meanings:** preserve production code and historical reporting; audit preservation, reference-required slots, entities and generation collapse.

### Top additional experiments
- **Native-tokenizer/provenance and forwarding-equivalence audit**, without training.
- **Paired adapter-only versus adapter-plus-LoRA B0** at layer19.
- After a positive result, **controlled numeric/date interventions**; use a **2×2 model×layer design** only if a general model-effect claim is needed.

